,"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":19,"created_at":"2024-12-03T16:26:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T11:02:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99971","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99971.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99971.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"I ran across this and wanted to try if it can't be improved. The throughput of `_find_upper` and `_find_lower` for normal latin is improved severalfold, making measurable difference in several benchmarks.\r\n\r\nHere are the benchmark results of 355dfadc58691c133222dde20aecece8d09de491 (this branch) vs ee4acfbfbf15b3528c34a8d4f65d66097e636044 (current master):\r\n\r\n![newplot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6690f6bc-f5df-4ef7-bf56-6ca41d8c8ba1)\r\n\r\nThe change also removes 896 bytes from the caps table (while adding only a few more in code).\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\nThis is taking advantage of the fact that most common (latin) text is in the [lower-bit range](https://www.fileformat.info/info/charset/UTF-32/list.htm) (ASCII). This is exploited by running an if-based algorithm instead of a binary search for this case.\r\nAs can be seen in the benchmarks (e.g. `find` vs `findn`), conversion of capitalization of a single common latin char is now almost free, compared to other parts of the algorithms.\r\n\r\nI have also adjusted moved the functions out of the generator script to make them easier to maintain (as plain C++ rather than strings). `char_utils` seemed like a fitting place since it already harbours similar functions.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99971/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99971/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}